dsmr-qmail-run (1.0-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Provides supervised service trees for qmail-send, qmail-smtpd (port 25),
    and qmail-submission (port 587).
  * Replaces the upstream qmail-run package (Conflicts/Replaces: qmail-run).
  * Handles retirement of the qmail-verify service on upgrade.
  * Installs updated qmailctl managing the three DSMR services.
  * Ensures daemontools-run.service is enabled and active.

